		this has to do with you trying to mail yourself. 
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.0 (6/30/15)
Sorry for the gap in update notes. These are the most recent changes, as I've 
forgotten some of what I've done in the prior iterations.

	* Changed throttle timer to give a little more time between mails to avoid being bumped from 
        the server for message rate spamming. Currently set to 1300ms.
		Looking into creating UI window for allow for user setting.
	* Made recipient list window a little taller, less scrolling needed.
	* Made ID column on recipient list a little wider. Was cutting off triple digit numbers.
	* Resized edit window to cut down on scrolling while writing mails.
	* Commented out GodSendRecipientsTotalRecipients:SetColor for the time being as it was  
		throwing some UI errors. Does not impact function. Working on resolution.

Known quirks:
* If you change guilds, please do a reloadui prior to opening GodSend or it'll throw a UI error.
